# Secure Cloud Project Document

Title: Cloud-Based Secure File Exchange and Access Management System
Author: Student Engineering Team
Date: September 2026
Cloud Platform: Amazon Web Services (AWS ap-south-1)

Summary:
This file demonstrates direct, account-free cloud-native file exchange between devices.
- Storage: Amazon S3 (Encrypted, Private Bucket, Pre-signed URL Authorization)
- Database: Amazon RDS PostgreSQL (Metadata, Cascade ACL, Parameterized Queries)
- Compute: Amazon EC2 (Node.js REST API with Helmet, Rate Limiting, Brute-force lockout)
- Security: Cryptographic Transfer Codes + Salted Bcrypt PIN Hashing
